# Two-panel layout:
#   bottom (Containment 2): kickoff (normal popup, NOT fullscreen) + icon-only
#     task manager (org.kde.plasma.icontasks, Win11 style) + edge separator.
#     No clock / no tray here.
#   top (Containment 30): window list (unchanged top-left) | spacer | lyrics
#     (com.github.illuminate-dev.onlyrics) + net speed + CPU + system tray +
#     clock, all grouped on the middle-right.
# Tray items (Containment 8): clipboard, notifications, volume, network,
# bluetooth, battery, brightness, kimpanel (fcitx5), ...
